  "question": {
    "html": "<p>Two isolated positive point charges Q<sub>1</sub> and Q<sub>2</sub> are equidistant from a third charge Q<sub>3</sub> as shown. The force on Q<sub>3</sub> due to Q<sub>1</sub> is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"F\"></span>. The force on Q<sub>3</sub> due to Q<sub>2</sub> is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2F\"></span>.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>What is the resultant force on Q<sub>3</sub>?<br/><br/></p>\n<p>[1]</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"F\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\sqrt{3}F\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\sqrt{5}F\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"3F\"></span></li></ol>"
